From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:46:07 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: apple,t6041-aop-audio: Select only T6041
 nodes

The schema lists the apple,t6030-aop-audio fallback, so dtbs_check
also applied it to the T6030, T6031 and T8122 AOP audio nodes, which
carry that fallback but only a microphone stream. They then failed on
the T6041 compatible, the DMA list and #sound-dai-cells. Select the
schema by the T6041 compatible only.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit 2c8754f8e0109bd6de6bfa0235b05217249ba3e9)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 .../bindings/sound/apple,t6041-aop-audio.yaml          | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,t6041-aop-audio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,t6041-aop-audio.yaml
index b9660e080a..1eadf9ff3b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,t6041-aop-audio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,t6041-aop-audio.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,16 @@ description: |
   The headset jack's channels are optional: a node without them has no jack
   streams.
 
+# Only select T6041 nodes: other AOP audio nodes carry the
+# apple,t6030-aop-audio fallback too and have a different set of streams.
+select:
+  properties:
+    compatible:
+      contains:
+        const: apple,t6041-aop-audio
+  required:
+    - compatible
+
 allOf:
   - $ref: dai-common.yaml#
 
